Priority: optional
Maintainer: LionOS Project <packaging@lionos.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cargo, rustc, libdbus-1-dev, pkg-config, dbus
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://lionos.org/
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/lionos-org/lion-greeter.git

Package: lion-greeter
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, dbus, libpam-runtime
Description: LionOS login daemon
 PAM authentication daemon for the LionOS login UI, with live
 second-factor prompt forwarding (2FA / security keys / smartcards),
 configurable autologin, XDG session selection, and logind-based fast
 user switching. Exposes a versioned, capability-flagged D-Bus API
 (org.lionos.Greeter1) reachable only by the unprivileged lion-login
 account. Zero heavy build dependencies (no bindgen/libclang).
